# Agent Workflow Kit Protocol

Use this rule in projects that install Agent Workflow Kit.

Before editing:

- Read `AGENTS.md`.
- Read `.agent/PROJECT_PLAN.md`.
- Read `.agent/TASKS.md`.
- Read the assigned `.agent/tasks/<task-id>.md`.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py start --task <task-id> --agent cursor`.

During work:

- Keep edits inside the task write scope.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py progress` after each meaningful phase.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py refresh` after re-reading changed plan or rule files.

Before completion:

- Run task verification commands.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py complete`.

